graph LR
    AI4RAG["ai4rag v0.26.0<br/>(Python library)"]

    %% Internal platform consumers / hosts
    PC["pipelines-components<br/>(AutoRAG KFP components)"] -->|Python import, consumer| AI4RAG
    DSP["data-science-pipelines /<br/>DSP operator"] -.->|runtime host, CA via SSL_CERT_DIR| PC

    %% Internal platform services
    AI4RAG -->|REST openai SDK, HTTPS/443| MaaS["Models-as-a-Service"]
    AI4RAG -->|boto3 S3 API, HTTPS/443| DataConn["ODH/RHOAI Data Connections (S3)"]

    %% Vector stores
    AI4RAG -->|pymilvus gRPC/19530| Milvus["Milvus / Zilliz"]
    AI4RAG -->|embedded, local file| MilvusLite["Milvus Lite"]
    AI4RAG -->|asyncpg 5432| PGVector["PostgreSQL + pgvector"]
    AI4RAG -->|neo4j driver Bolt/7687| Neo4j["Neo4j (graph RAG)"]
    AI4RAG -.->|connected mode, HTTPS/443| HF["Hugging Face Hub"]

    %% Key libraries
    AI4RAG -->|chat/embeddings client| OpenAI["openai ~=2.53"]
    AI4RAG -->|agentic RAG, splitters| LangChain["LangChain 1.x"]
    AI4RAG -->|document model, chunking| Docling["docling-slim ~=2.145"]
    AI4RAG -->|evaluation| Eval["ragas / unitxt"]
    AI4RAG -->|HPO surrogate| PyGAM["pygam / scikit-learn / pandas"]
    AI4RAG -.->|text-extraction extra| OCR["rapidocr / onnxruntime /<br/>huggingface-hub / ffmpeg"]

